version: 2.0.0
description: |
  Integration tests for paradigm-mcp — covers schema-mutating tools (portal/purpose writers) with write-verify assertions. First tests/ file added in v5.37.11 as regression protection for the silent-no-op bug class.
components:
  portal-writer-tests:
    description: Regression suite for addGateToPortal/addRouteToPortal covering Array→{} normalization, read-back verification, and silent-no-op protection on v2 scaffold shapes
    type: test
    anchors:
      - portal-writer.test.ts:1-400
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - portal
  yaml-validator-tests:
    description: Regression suite for safeLoad — missing / unparseable / invalid / ok discriminated union; SECURITY assertion that unparseable detail does NOT contain raw file contents, gate names, or route paths. Added v5.37.12.
    type: test
    anchors:
      - yaml-validator.test.ts:1-200
    tags:
      - test
      - regression
      - security
      - fail-closed
